            "The \"Signal-to-Noise\" Audit: Before reacting, ask: \"Is the other person busy, or are they actually ignoring me?\" Most of the time, the \"network\" is just congested. Acknowledging that their silence isn't a \"system crash\" on your end reduces the sting.",
